              "uco-observable:stringValue": "Query Reports Utilities Help Log Out\n\nMJSELECT-SDE\n\nU.S. District Court\nEastern District of New York (Brooklyn)\nCRIMINAL DOCKET FOR CASE #: 1:25-cr-00361-PKC All Defendants\n\nCase title: USA v. Bermudez et al Date Filed: 11/18/2025\n\nAssigned to: Judge Pamela K. Chen\n\nDefendant (1)\nHector Bermudez represented by Gary Matthew Kaufman\nalso known as Law Office of Gary Kaufman, PLLC\nFiasco 377 Broadway, 8th Floor\nalso known as New York, NY 10013\nRogue 347-855-9102\nalso known as Fax: 212-202-7949\nDiablo Email: gary@garykaufmanlaw.com\nLEAD ATTORNEY\nATTORNEY TO BE NOTICED\nDesignation: CJA Appointment\n\nNicholas Hine\nHine Law PLLC\nP.O. Box 170096\nBrooklyn, NY 11217\n406-272-2481\nEmail: nth@hine.law\nLEAD ATTORNEY\nATTORNEY TO BE NOTICED\nDesignation: CJA Appointment\n\nPending Counts Disposition\nTitle 18, United States Code, Sections 2252A(g) and 3551 et seq.- Child Exploitation Enterprise.\n(1)\nTitle 18, United States Code, Sections 2251(a), 2251(e) and 3551 et seq.- Conspiracy to Sexually\nExploit Children.\n(2)\nTitle 18, United States Code, Sections 2252(a)(2), 2252(b)(1) and 3551 et seq.-Conspiracy to\nReceive and Distribute Child Pornography.\n(3)\nTitle 18, United States Code, Sections 2252(a)(4)(B), 2252(b)(2), 2 and 3551 et seq.- Access with\nIntent to View Child Pornography - Minor Victim 2.\n(4)\nTitle 18, United States Code, Sections 2251(a), 2251(e), 2 and 3551 et seq.- Sexual Exploitation -\nMinor Victim 3.\n(5)\nTitle 18, United States Code, Sections 2252(a)(4)(B), 2252(b)(2), 2 and 3551 et seq.- Access with\nIntent to View Child Pornography - Minor Victim 3.\n(6)\nTitle 18, United States Code, Sections 2251(a), 2251(e), 2 and 3551 et seq.- Sexual Exploitation -\nMinor Victim 4.\n(7)\nTitle 18, United States Code, Sections 2252(a)(4)(B), 2252(b)(2), 2 and 3551 et seq.- Access with\nIntent to View Child Pornography-Minor Victim 4.\n(8)\nTitle 18, United States Code, Sections 2252(a)(2), 2252(b)(1), 2 and 3551 et seq.- Distribution of\nChild Pornography - Minor Victim 5.\n(9)\nTitle 18, United States Code, Sections 371 and 3551 et seq.- Conspiracy to Communicate\nInterstate Threats.\n(10)\n\nHighest Offense Level (Opening)\nFelony\n\nTerminated Counts Disposition\nNone\n\nHighest Offense Level (Terminated)\nNone\n\nComplaints Disposition\nNone\n\nAssigned to: Judge Pamela K. Chen\n\nDefendant (2)\nDavid Brilhante represented by John C Ellis , Jr\nalso known as Law Offices of John C. Ellis, Jr. INC.\nKnight Law Offices of John C. Ellis, Jr. INC.\nalso known as 2495 Truxtun Road\nCS:GO Ste 206\nSan Diego, CA 92106\n619-501-5522\nEmail: john@johnellislaw.com\nLEAD ATTORNEY\nPRO HAC VICE\nATTORNEY TO BE NOTICED\nDesignation: Retained\n\nPending Counts Disposition\nTitle 18, United States Code, Sections 2252A(g) and 3551 et seq.- Child Exploitation Enterprise.\n(1)\nTitle 18, United States Code, Sections 2251(a), 2251(e) and 3551 et seq.- Conspiracy to Sexually\nExploit Children.\n(2)\nTitle 18, United States Code, Sections 2252(a)(2), 2252(b)(1) and 3551 et seq.-Conspiracy to\nReceive and Distribute Child Pornography.\n(3)\n\nHighest Offense Level (Opening)\nFelony\n\nTerminated Counts Disposition\nNone\nHighest Offense Level (Terminated)\nNone\n\nComplaints Disposition\nNone\n\nAssigned to: Judge Pamela K. Chen\n\nDefendant (3)\nZachary Dosch represented by Sally J.M. Butler\nalso known as 42-40 Bell Blvd, Suite 302\nMoist Nigerian Bayside, NY 11361\n718-279-4500\nFax: 718-281-0850\nEmail: SallyButlerEsq@yahoo.com\nLEAD ATTORNEY\nATTORNEY TO BE NOTICED\nDesignation: CJA Appointment\n\nPending Counts Disposition\nTitle 18, United States Code, Sections 2252A(g) and 3551 et seq.- Child Exploitation Enterprise.\n(1)\nTitle 18, United States Code, Sections 2251(a), 2251(e) and 3551 et seq.- Conspiracy to Sexually\nExploit Children.\n(2)\nTitle 18, United States Code, Sections 2252(a)(2), 2252(b)(1) and 3551 et seq.-Conspiracy to\nReceive and Distribute Child 